    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470170/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1754715594\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy playing at the casino with the original card game, &quot;Queens&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each turn, cards are randomly dealt, and you play them according to specific rules. If you can clear all the &quot;Subjectives&quot; presented by the heroine, you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each heroine comes with her own unique additional rules, and every stage features completely different &quot;Subjectives,&quot; requiring distinct strategies for every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a simple yet deep game that demands thinking a few steps ahead through a series of engaging choices...!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470170/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1754715594\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill System: Activate various skills using MP, which builds up as you play cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop: Purchase skills, hunt for the ultimate combos, and expand your strategies.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470170/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1754715594\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy playing at the casino with the original card game, &quot;Queens&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each turn, cards are randomly dealt, and you play them according to specific rules. If you can clear all the &quot;Subjectives&quot; presented by the heroine, you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each heroine comes with her own unique additional rules, and every stage features completely different &quot;Subjectives,&quot; requiring distinct strategies for every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a simple yet deep game that demands thinking a few steps ahead through a series of engaging choices...!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470170/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1754715594\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill System: Activate various skills using MP, which builds up as you play cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop: Purchase skills, hunt for the ultimate combos, and expand your strategies.</p></li></ul>",
